    "name": "Elixir Emporium",
    "steam_appid": 3039840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/8856f5153470a622ca90bfe529c8e242.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARVESTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where every object is interactive. Use any item on any object to discover new resources and hidden treasures. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harvest resources from the environment in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experiment with various item-object interactions to uncover unique results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Never run out of things to discover and collect in your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/00c217ae9dd603d1cb47a9752c5575fb.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALCHEMY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine any two items to create something entirely new. The art of alchemy lets you experiment and discover countless combinations, each with its unique effects and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mix and match any items to see what you can create.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every combination has the potential to surprise and delight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash your creativity and find the most powerful concoctions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/7a878906cb8e9b0f27878e5d4be323b9.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate items using a variety of unique workstations. Each workstation offers different crafting possibilities, allowing you to make even more choices about the new items you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft the perfect items to aid you on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover new recipes and unlock advanced crafting techniques as you level up your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/cee07328bdcd3978eed01aadc48c7709.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train 8 skills as you interact with the world, unlocking perks with each level and new ways to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft weapons, armor and tools at a variety of workstations at the blacksmith</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft clothing, accessories, and other useful items at other workstations such as the loom, crusher, sharpening stone, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Alchemy, Cooking, Crafting, Divinity, Herblore, Mining, Nature, and Smithing to maximize your prowess as a traveling alchemist in this world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/c83b20f596fced9f8410c5c01fcf48b3.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVING NPCs </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with living, breathing NPCs who have their own wants, needs, and goals. Every NPC lives a dynamic life, interacting with you and the world in meaningful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > NPCs pursue their own goals and needs, whether or not you intervene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Influence NPCs to shape the world according to your desires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a world where NPCs interact with each other and you in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy open-ended conversations where you can say anything, leading to organic and unpredictable interactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/b96e4a61f328fd8421e75b981c9af9d6.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NON-DETERMINISTIC QUESTS &amp; EVENTS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience infinite replayability with non-deterministic quests and events. The world evolves based on your actions, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quests and events change based on your actions and the state of the world, offering a new experience every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your decisions shape the world and its inhabitants.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/8856f5153470a622ca90bfe529c8e242.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARVESTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where every object is interactive. Use any item on any object to discover new resources and hidden treasures. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harvest resources from the environment in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experiment with various item-object interactions to uncover unique results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Never run out of things to discover and collect in your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/00c217ae9dd603d1cb47a9752c5575fb.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALCHEMY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine any two items to create something entirely new. The art of alchemy lets you experiment and discover countless combinations, each with its unique effects and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mix and match any items to see what you can create.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every combination has the potential to surprise and delight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash your creativity and find the most powerful concoctions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/7a878906cb8e9b0f27878e5d4be323b9.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate items using a variety of unique workstations. Each workstation offers different crafting possibilities, allowing you to make even more choices about the new items you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft the perfect items to aid you on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover new recipes and unlock advanced crafting techniques as you level up your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/cee07328bdcd3978eed01aadc48c7709.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train 8 skills as you interact with the world, unlocking perks with each level and new ways to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft weapons, armor and tools at a variety of workstations at the blacksmith</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft clothing, accessories, and other useful items at other workstations such as the loom, crusher, sharpening stone, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Alchemy, Cooking, Crafting, Divinity, Herblore, Mining, Nature, and Smithing to maximize your prowess as a traveling alchemist in this world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/c83b20f596fced9f8410c5c01fcf48b3.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVING NPCs </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with living, breathing NPCs who have their own wants, needs, and goals. Every NPC lives a dynamic life, interacting with you and the world in meaningful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > NPCs pursue their own goals and needs, whether or not you intervene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Influence NPCs to shape the world according to your desires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a world where NPCs interact with each other and you in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy open-ended conversations where you can say anything, leading to organic and unpredictable interactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039840/extras/b96e4a61f328fd8421e75b981c9af9d6.avif?t=1738349940\" data-has-big width=800 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NON-DETERMINISTIC QUESTS &amp; EVENTS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience infinite replayability with non-deterministic quests and events. The world evolves based on your actions, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quests and events change based on your actions and the state of the world, offering a new experience every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your decisions shape the world and its inhabitants.</p></li></ul>",
